{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Add your lovely stepsister on your desktop. Make sure she is not stuck anywhere!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game allows you to add pretty girl on your desktop at top of all other applications. Play games, do your homework or listen to music, you stepsister will be with you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can move her around, change her size and rotate as you like</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stepsister will change her clothes times to times, but do not try to spy on her</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">She is very restless and will and can get stuck in various objects, for example in the washing machine, help her!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">She likes to talk, commenting your actions and can have custom voice lines from workshop</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect achievements just for spending time with her</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3615360?t=1744890378","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3615360?t=1744890378","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615360/02c7254f40eeecbbe0aa431a6c6bc1a2d7227031/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744890378","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615360/02c7254f40eeecbbe0aa431a6c6bc1a2d7227031/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744890378","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Add your lovely stepsister on your desktop. Make sure she is not stuck anywhere!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game allows you to add pretty girl on your desktop at top of all other applica